      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} I can understand why VRChat would want to keep basic filtering for instance IDs that contain non-numeric characters, for obvious reasons, hence I suggested skipping the word filter only when the instance ID name is numeric.",
